            <div xml:id="m-3843fe56-1e27-4b09-b20a-3134760626bc">
              <lg xml:id="m-81eba1c7-bc45-44c8-8c59-70506d433b20">
                <l xml:id="m-8b9cafff-4b12-4fa1-bbe1-761211c9c65e" facs="#m-27cf5274-c747-4d0b-b1be-d4de6fb1429d" label="text-like">At Matins.</l><l xml:id="m-b6430b64-7150-43a9-920b-fd09da02cbe4" facs="#m-04f48170-8b88-4e83-b764-7b7e54e95a7d" label="ambiguous">380</l><l xml:id="m-5acf7ace-8b83-4a11-b413-0c4147bfd22d" facs="#m-51f6caab-07fb-46dc-98b7-a779bf032890" label="lyrics-like">v. Ipse invocábit me, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-3f9be425-6487-4998-94e7-5b4d7d7cf34c" facs="#m-9dfd9d93-f43a-4e7c-b264-0778ff42eb4a" label="lyrics-like">N. Pá-ter mé-us es tu, alle-lú-ia.</l><l xml:id="m-4de082b4-f624-40c5-95ab-e44fdad8bc87" facs="#m-8af02cb1-cd5e-41e7-aba0-22052a4ed33f" label="ambiguous">Pater noster.</l><l xml:id="m-4783130b-d0e4-4a24-a6fc-e54414eeaf58" facs="#m-e6b4b4bd-32ab-469f-8189-c503b46e7e46" label="lyrics-like">Absolutton. A vínculis peccatórum nostrórum absólvat nos omní¬</l><l xml:id="m-3ceda72c-136a-4741-a0e8-ce27de8ff161" facs="#m-42d803ba-38b1-453b-813f-965db03de88e" label="lyrics-like">potens et miséricors Dóminus. K. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-49cb4fd9-8506-43b3-9d36-7854e7bb7c9c" facs="#m-aeb39df8-182e-4990-819c-1833cfd739e1" label="lyrics-like">The Lector : Jube, domne, benedícere.</l><l xml:id="m-6f7ac593-7403-43a7-b2bd-41232d4ee601" facs="#m-22e5d020-3faf-4526-95c2-837666577c9f" label="lyrics-like">Blessing. Evangélica léctio“ sit nobis salus et protéctio. B. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-e1fdaa37-7340-4fb8-8752-41648b9ab376" facs="#m-b2723c31-ba89-4aaa-b219-f21489654ae3" label="lyrics-like">Léctio sancti Evangélii secúndum Lucam.</l><l xml:id="m-2621f726-f6b2-445d-9fc3-92bb3ab4cfc1" facs="#m-deaebd04-eac1-4d4f-bb9f-8f8d79f46f1b" label="ambiguous">Lesson VII.</l><l xml:id="m-0809afa8-e886-4150-be28-183f6d5cdc55" facs="#m-8e0e514d-71f6-49ad-9e4b-dcc7007203f8" label="ambiguous">Chap. 2.</l><l xml:id="m-c3c131d9-1633-45e7-8a43-f3d566d12c5c" facs="#m-48bba545-51ff-4fe3-a8b7-a7d58dd6400e" label="lyrics-like">N illo témpore: Exiit edíctum al tium, et cum justis non scribántur.</l><l xml:id="m-c62909cb-4f5c-48e4-b94a-a523ed4ea69d" facs="#m-a862331a-23c1-41e0-bcbb-2ab36f8c2795" label="lyrics-like">Qui bene étiam in Béthlehem násci¬</l><l xml:id="m-09b497eb-1c78-4ce1-b8a8-6782bd0d5690" facs="#m-d383d1a8-a365-4686-ad67-a134346c7a7d" label="lyrics-like">1 Caésare Augústo, ut describe¬</l><l xml:id="m-08051ba4-6894-4e41-8b6a-f62c14c211fa" facs="#m-aed8e34f-0a4d-496d-88f7-0792ec4fd6a1" label="lyrics-like">tur : Béthlehem quippe domus panis</l><l xml:id="m-49526475-955b-4bf8-82ed-e7efc54bbf84" facs="#m-1c229e2a-8d57-44df-a555-b63789b014ef" label="lyrics-like">rétur univérsus orbis. Et réliqua.</l><l xml:id="m-35ddf7d3-0fa3-4bb8-ab88-40847137820b" facs="#m-ade867ae-9059-43fa-a320-4d5e35b23ba5" label="lyrics-like">interpretátur. Ipse namque est, qui</l><l xml:id="m-cb0b33bc-e0ad-424a-820f-31bbe4179d1d" facs="#m-c77e73ad-1e0f-4f7f-9d5a-fb6b59843738" label="lyrics-like">Homilia sancti Gregórii Papae.</l><l xml:id="m-4c4b80f7-67d4-4a35-9e64-7375152b99c5" facs="#m-30f44dd6-cee5-4f5b-b128-411fc599c303" label="ambiguous">ait: Ego sum panis vivus, qui de</l><l xml:id="m-ce7128cc-2620-4229-b7cd-ba48cd6b392d" facs="#m-0cf557d8-8179-4987-b4fb-7258729c3c2a" label="lyrics-like">Uia, largiénte Dómino, Missá¬</l><l xml:id="m-f702120a-d7bb-46a3-85aa-af94522d5771" facs="#m-579c575c-dc0d-4b50-aca1-ee81b06260ef" label="lyrics-like">caelo descéndi. Locus ergo, in quo</l><l xml:id="m-823ff678-6e47-4b83-9449-2324a269c046" facs="#m-dcd453d6-a0b0-4636-aa38-5be4c8cb48e0" label="lyrics-like">Dóminus náscitur, domus panis</l><l xml:id="m-2a89cbb0-a0e4-498c-8a7b-20b78925d094" facs="#m-d44bbffa-af15-4e2d-bc51-95d45544b65d" label="lyrics-like">Urum solémnia ter hódie cele¬</l><l xml:id="m-48d0cc04-d923-4752-a8de-57cfecbf9fe3" facs="#m-11b85be0-f751-4ffc-a95f-2e960b2476f0" label="lyrics-like">ántea vocátus est; quia futürum</l><l xml:id="m-093d514d-03b3-4e26-942d-71f44bdeee72" facs="#m-3cf87c09-b236-442e-96e3-13d1fb753f20" label="lyrics-like">bratúri sumus, loqui diu de evan¬</l><l xml:id="m-df20fe79-af43-4343-9455-493e4a9e68bf" facs="#m-8ff0c48b-1c94-4945-92cf-0e31fbda61e2" label="lyrics-like">profécto erat, ut ille ibi per maté¬</l><l xml:id="m-19ddeff8-152c-4c23-99c2-bfe88f6ba8fa" facs="#m-059344de-77c1-434c-83fe-b865a0e680c7" label="lyrics-like">gélica lectióne non póssumus; sed</l><l xml:id="m-0f46bb1a-021f-4e91-a3bc-2d6c8ca98dd3" facs="#m-58fd3cc8-5c78-46d3-ab7b-89c184aafa1d" label="lyrics-like">riam carnis apparéret, qui electó¬</l><l xml:id="m-dc6c1940-9c0d-43cf-9bdb-edfb03f09920" facs="#m-d71e8b56-a613-4880-ac89-51cfc489dd3c" label="lyrics-like">nos áliquid vel bréviter dicere, Red¬</l><l xml:id="m-11f25383-fe68-4e0b-8c8d-5380219efdfc" facs="#m-cece5e66-aa3e-4000-b5fc-4093469444d5" label="lyrics-like">rum mentes intérna satietáte refi¬</l><l xml:id="m-07af24d2-3515-48f9-bfa0-43632fb2c2fb" facs="#m-2866692c-c415-4a61-8849-e994d7db0493" label="lyrics-like">emptóris nostri Nativitas ipsa com¬</l><l xml:id="m-e5e9ea55-8fb1-40dc-82bb-e839476329ee" facs="#m-fdd55adf-6af3-4dc5-a777-4734a431174a" label="lyrics-like">ceret. Qui non in paréntum domo,</l><l xml:id="m-7eab3170-1c0c-4fb2-8d58-52a446dfe57c" facs="#m-81af4cc8-e108-4e55-a11b-a072c78916e3" label="lyrics-like">péllit. Quid est enim, quod nascitúro</l><l xml:id="m-4e0eca29-8586-4c89-af55-73eedc872ea9" facs="#m-dd00659c-a915-4db8-ab38-82241d41564b" label="lyrics-like">sed in via náscitur; ut profécto</l><l xml:id="m-9ace4b10-19fa-45f4-9beb-e418d0911fd8" facs="#m-2f3d419f-8018-441c-aff7-04fe2a870597" label="lyrics-like">Dómino mundus describitur, nisi</l><l xml:id="m-cd4b8a33-d7ec-4210-9249-da0ec0b08e20" facs="#m-f3cee3ee-f1e3-4e17-b457-c3bb0f466741" label="lyrics-like">osténderet, quia per humanitátem</l><l xml:id="m-d7ef1a23-b454-4d61-ac88-db9640fa0b18" facs="#m-b830c794-feb5-43ec-9795-cb10ba164861" label="lyrics-like">hoc, quod apérte monstrátur, quia</l><l xml:id="m-28c5b7f1-bb84-431e-9764-2c1eb6f882bf" facs="#m-c587c769-1f7e-4ffb-bbbb-30d283012c87" label="lyrics-like">suam, quam assúmpserat, quasi in</l><l xml:id="m-1722bfec-0881-48d7-baa0-ba0616e078e3" facs="#m-299779b6-a815-46de-b08a-006940b6e024" label="lyrics-like">ille apparébat in carne, qui eléctos</l><l xml:id="m-7182f698-e841-4f1c-bbf1-5eda89689bb5" facs="#m-c1c75782-cffb-441a-b8d3-5f39f20e59a8" label="lyrics-like">aliéno nascebátur. Tu autem, Dó¬</l><l xml:id="m-5a77ae6d-b97a-477f-b8e2-818838f8b467" facs="#m-740f5096-0fd6-4c46-8cf8-df1259b5e94b" label="lyrics-like">suos adscriberet in aeternitáte? Quo</l><l xml:id="m-38f5fce1-c30d-40be-870d-09f297c948b3" facs="#m-322b2047-e1ac-4b65-98a0-312c703d35a0" label="lyrics-like">mine, miserére nobis.</l><l xml:id="m-aae5bb73-9a99-4c93-9841-0c5dce993fb2" facs="#m-2ecefaa2-a4c5-41fd-bc55-12fd0a7cf00f" label="lyrics-like">contra de réprobis per prophétam</l><l xml:id="m-cb5c9432-6374-457f-9c86-964bdd1c33c2" facs="#m-ad104565-7877-4a43-bf11-15798dd50571" label="lyrics-like">K. Déo grátias.</l><l xml:id="m-448d8f50-e4fd-4075-b3ac-2a7c6e22c542" facs="#m-1c0cb6a6-00f6-48ef-9e1e-331404e4132f" label="lyrics-like">dicitur: Deleántur de libro vivén¬</l><l xml:id="m-aa099b2a-4b4b-4bed-97ab-6a592ac4832e" facs="#m-89219310-21f5-44c7-a902-ef81f7ea52f7" label="ambiguous">7.Resp.a</l><l xml:id="m-cea586df-4414-4c9d-bbbf-59e8417476d7" facs="#m-e9d88794-f218-46ee-9629-a229af6fcf87" label="ambiguous">7</l><l xml:id="m-8c780e96-36b6-4d11-b580-222db2df5dbe" facs="#m-0fc1a19e-f16a-47bb-9bd9-7f42b80c0eae" label="ambiguous">B</l><l xml:id="m-094f9da8-6ef7-4d10-9c2e-1479c78683e5" facs="#m-8a2ed033-b8a1-4e9b-ac19-ab33203a7c46" label="lyrics-like">E-á-ta" ví- sce- ra Ma-rí-ae Vírgi-nis,</l><l xml:id="m-e2afc2f5-8b1e-4892-9858-2341c6c7411c" facs="#m-47c7ac57-2d08-4a09-a336-2aad6b19cea9" label="lyrics-like">ni Pátris</l><l xml:id="m-31c7930f-6029-43de-a9c8-02187408f00b" facs="#m-272ef1a4-7c86-49bb-92e4-974728a8a633" label="ambiguous">Fi-li¬</l><l xml:id="m-0d625d68-eece-4d4d-a286-5347179d1ca0" facs="#m-f51e8f6a-9d12-4cd8-b792-9afcd363f13d" label="ambiguous">um : et</l><l xml:id="m-c5a2b8ac-c6d7-4e95-86dd-edcceb6bc5e7" facs="#m-0907461d-4b78-4291-8a57-a408de3d2bb6" label="lyrics-like">quae portavérunt aetér¬</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
